<ans># Care Health Insurance Ltd — Q1FY25 Financial Data Extraction

## Overview

The following data was extracted directly from Care Health Insurance Limited's **IRDAI Quarterly Public Disclosure ("NL" return set)** for the quarter ended 30 June 2024 (Q1FY25). No standalone Q1FY25 investor presentation could be located publicly — Care Health Insurance is an unlisted entity (majority-owned by Religare Enterprises, ~84.09% promoter holding per the shareholding pattern in the disclosure), and unlisted insurers are not obligated to publish quarterly investor decks. As such, all figures below — including headline GWP and PAT — are sourced from the single authoritative statutory NL filing.

