ps://www.turtlemintinsurance.com/health-insurance/care/", "snippet": "<strong>Up to Rs.</strong> 6 Crores of the sum insured with the option to renew the policy throughout the lifetime of the policyholder"}}}, "step29_PythonRepl42": {"step": 29, "title": "Python Execution: \n# Values extracted from NL-1, NL-2, NL-3 (BS), NL-4, NL-20 of the Q1FY25 Public Disclosure PDF\n# Al...", "toolName": "PythonRepl", "snippet": "Output: \"Total GWP 1931.12\\nNet Written Premium (NWP) 1088.14\\nNet Earned Premium (NEP) 1445.22\\nPAT_IGAAP 83.16\\nClaims_ratio 67\\nEoM_ratio 34\\nExpense_ratio_GDP 35\\nCommission_ratio 17\\nCombined_ratio 101\\n...", "raw_data": {"code": "\n# Values extracted from NL-1, NL-2, NL-3 (BS), NL-4, NL-20 of the Q1FY25 Public Disclosure PDF\n# All amounts in Rs. Lakhs in source -> convert to INR Crore (1 Cr = 100 Lakhs)\n\ndata = {\n\"Total GWP\": 1931.12,          # NL-4 Gross Direct Premium total for quarter (Rs Lakhs 1,93,112 -> Cr 1931.12)\n\"Net Written Premium (NWP)\": 1088.14,   # NL-1 Premiums earned net row shows NWP figure per NL-4 breakup: Net Written Premium = 1,08,814 (quarter) actually check\n\"Net Earned Premium (NEP)\": 1445.22,    # NL-1 \"Premiums earned (Net)\" = 1,44,522 Lakhs\n\"PAT_IGAAP\": 83.16,             # NL-2 Profit/Loss After Tax = 8,316 Lakhs\n\"Claims_ratio\": 67,             # NL-20 Net Incurred Claims to NEP ratio = 0.67 -> 67%\n\"EoM_ratio\": 34,                # NL-20 Expense of Mgmt to Net Written Premium Ratio = 0.34 -> 34%\n\"Expense_ratio_GDP\": 35,        # NL-20 Expense of Mgmt to Gross Direct Premium Ratio = 0.35 -> 35%\n\"Commission_ratio\": 17,         # NL-20 Net Commission Ratio = 0.17 -> 17%\n\"Combined_ratio\": 101,          # NL-20 Combined Ratio = 1.01 -> 101%\n\"Solvency_ratio\": 1.64,         # NL-26 Solvency Ratio = 1.64\n\"Net_worth\": 1218.86,           # NL-3 BS Shareholders Funds Reserves&Surplus 97,239+... total sources of funds = 1,21,886 Lakhs\n\"Investments_total\": 6833.65,   # NL-12/12A Total Investments = 6,83,365 Lakhs\n}\n\nfor k,v in data.items():\n    print(k, v)\n", "result": "\"Total GWP 1931.12\\nNet Written Premium (NWP) 1088.14\\nNet Earned Premium (NEP) 1445.22\\nPAT_IGAAP 83.16\\nClaims_ratio 67\\nEoM_ratio 34\\nExpense_ratio_GDP 35\\nCommission_ratio 17\\nCombined_ratio 101\\nSolvency_ratio 1.64\\nNet_worth 1218.86\\nInvestments_total 6833.65\\n\""}}, "step33_PythonRepl43": {"step": 33, "title": "Python Execution: \n# Convert Rs. Lakhs to INR Crore (1 crore = 100 lakhs)\ndata = {\n    \"Total GWP\": 1931.12,          ...", "toolName": "PythonRepl", "snippet": "Output: \"Total GWP 1931.12\\nNWP 1088.14\\nNEP 1445.22\\nPAT_IGAAP 83.16\\nClaims_ratio 67\\nEoM_ratio_GDP 35\\nEoM_ratio_NWP 34\\nCommission_ratio 17\\nCombined_ratio 101\\nSolvency_ratio 1.64\\nNet_worth 1218.86\\nInv...", "raw_data": {"code": "\n# Convert Rs. Lakhs to INR Crore (1 crore = 100 lakhs)\ndata = {\n    \"Total GWP\": 1931.12,          # NL-4 Gross Direct Premium total = 193112 Lakhs -> /100 = 1931.12 Cr\n    \"NWP\": 1088.14,                 # NL-4 Net Written Premium = 108814 Lakhs\n    \"NEP\": 1445.22,                 # NL-1/NL-4 Net Earned Premium (Net) = 144522 Lakhs\n    \"PAT_IGAAP\": 83.16,             # NL-2 Profit after tax = 8316 Lakhs\n    \"Claims_ratio\": 67,             # NL-20 Net Incurred Claims to NEP = 0.67\n    \"EoM_ratio_GDP\": 35,            # NL-20 Expense of Mgmt to GDP ratio = 0.35\n    \"EoM_ratio_NWP\": 34,            # NL-20 Expense of Mgmt to NWP ratio = 0.34\n    \"Commission_ratio\": 17,         # NL-20 Net commission ratio = 0.17\n    \"Combined_ratio\": 101,          # NL-20 Combined ratio = 1.01\n    \"Solvency_ratio\": 1.64,         # NL-26 Solvency ratio\n    \"Net_worth\": 1218.86,           # BS Shareholders funds = 121886 Lakhs\n    \"Investments_total\": 6833.65,   # NL-12/12A Total Investments = 683365 Lakhs\n}\nfor k,v in data.items():\n    print(k, v)\n", "result": "\"Total GWP 1931.12\\nNWP 1088.14\\nNEP 1445.22\\nPAT_IGAAP 83.16\\nClaims_ratio 67\\nEoM_ratio_GDP 35\\nEoM_ratio_NWP 34\\nCommission_ratio 17\\nCombined_ratio 101\\nSolvency_ratio 1.64\\nNet_worth 1218.86\\nInvestments_total 6833.65\\n\""}}}</sources>
